<Base
  title="Terms of Service — EmailSubjectScore Pro"
  description="Terms of service for EmailSubjectScore Pro Chrome extension."
  canonical="https://amrita-labs.com/gmail-subject-score/terms/"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 prose prose-invert prose-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Terms of Service — EmailSubjectScore Pro</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400"><strong>Effective Date</strong>: 2026-05-18 · <strong>Last Updated</strong>: 2026-07-15</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">1. Acceptance</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">By installing or using EmailSubjectScore Pro ("the Extension"), you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, uninstall the Extension.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">2. Description of Service</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">EmailSubjectScore Pro is a Chrome extension that scores email subject lines on spam likelihood, clarity, and urgency, and offers AI-powered rewrite suggestions inside Gmail compose.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">3. Free and Paid Tiers</h2>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li><strong>Free tier</strong>: 50 subject scores per month (10 per day). No account required.</li>
