      <li>Reverse-engineer the scoring algorithm or API</li>
      <li>Use the Extension for bulk email spam generation</li>
      <li>Resell access to the Extension's API</li>
      <li>Submit content that violates applicable laws</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">5. AI-Generated Content</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Rewrite suggestions are generated by AI (GPT-4.1-mini via Azure OpenAI). You are responsible for reviewing and editing any AI-generated subject lines before sending. We do not guarantee that AI suggestions will improve email deliverability or open rates.</p>

