      <li>Subject lines you compose are yours — we claim no ownership</li>
      <li>AI-generated suggestions are provided as-is; no copyright claim is made on AI outputs</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">7. Payment and Refunds</h2>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li>Pro subscriptions are billed monthly or annually in USD</li>
      <li>Refunds handled case-by-case — request via <a href="mailto:hello@amrita-labs.com" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">hello@amrita-labs.com</a></li>
      <li>Cancel anytime; access continues until end of billing period; no fees</li>
      <li>Subscriptions auto-renew at the same rate unless canceled</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">8. Privacy</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">See our <a href="/gmail-subject-score/privacy/" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> for details on data collection, use, and your rights.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">9. Disclaimers</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">THE EXTENSION IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. We do not guarantee accuracy of scores, that AI suggestions will improve performance, uninterrupted operation, or compatibility with future Gmail updates.</p>

